            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nI'll look into it, but this goal is achievable with `:'<,'>norm! f,x` (with `!`), isn't it? Or you have some other use cases?\r\n\r\nFirst debugging shows that cursor is properly placed on those `,` characters. It is later keys which are not processed...",
