            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should be fixed on latest `main` branch.\r\n\r\nThe reason was that `:normal-range` doesn't issue `CursorMoved` when it moves cursor on start of every line. As this event is used to stop smart jumping (when you press `ftFT` to repeat jump with same target), this lead to some complications.",
